Patch-Source: https://github.com/kjdev/php-ext-brotli/pull/101

Fix racy tests sharing tests/data.out.

streams_001, streams_002 and streams_004 all write, stat and unlink the very
same file tests/data.out. Since php-src 1d2ea5ce22c ("Run tests in parallel by
default", GH-22939, first released in php-8.6.0beta1) run-tests.php spawns
min(nproc, 10) workers by default, so these three tests race each other and
fail intermittently - filesize()/file_get_contents() hit a path a sibling test
has just unlinked.

Give each test its own scratch file, the way tests/dictionary_streams.phpt
already does.

diff -Naur brotli-0.20.0.orig/tests/streams_001.phpt brotli-0.20.0/tests/streams_001.phpt
--- a/tests/streams_001.phpt
+++ b/tests/streams_001.phpt
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 <?php
 include(dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.inc');
 
-$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.out';
+$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data_' . basename(__FILE__, ".php") . '.out';
 
 echo "Compression with default level\n";
 
diff -Naur brotli-0.20.0.orig/tests/streams_002.phpt brotli-0.20.0/tests/streams_002.phpt
--- a/tests/streams_002.phpt
+++ b/tests/streams_002.phpt
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 <?php
 include(dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.inc');
 
-$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.out';
+$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data_' . basename(__FILE__, ".php") . '.out';
 
 echo "Stream compression + brotli_uncompress\n";
 
diff -Naur brotli-0.20.0.orig/tests/streams_004.phpt brotli-0.20.0/tests/streams_004.phpt
--- a/tests/streams_004.phpt
+++ b/tests/streams_004.phpt
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 <?php
 include(dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.inc');
 
-$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data.out';
+$file = dirname(__FILE__) . '/data_' . basename(__FILE__, ".php") . '.out';
 
 echo "Compression\n";
 
